    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "It follows from Proposition 1.5 that Z ≤ (1+o(1))E[Z] = (1+o(1))23n a.a.s. Since Z stochastically dominates |BC|, we may conclude 21|BC| ≤ (1 + o(1))n3 a.a.s., completing the proof."
